WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:53.550
<b>Marine Branch 153
Shells Town, East Blue</b>

3
00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:54.800
"Cabin Boy"

4
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:03.660
Hey, quit slackin' off!

5
00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:04.360
Ouch!

6
00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:05.230
Hey, chore boys!

7
00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.170
Wash the windows when
you're finished here.

8
00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.140
Sir!

9
00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:13.240
<b>The Trials of Koby-Meppo</b>

10
00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.270
[MARINES]
One, two, three, four.
One, two, three, four.

11
00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:13.940
One, two, three,
four. One, two...

12
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.150
Uh... I can't stand this!

13
00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:23.200
Koby can be the model chore boy if
he wants, but why do I have to do it?

14
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.550
Damn it!

15
00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:30.120
If it weren't for that stupid straw hat
guy, none of this would of happened!

16
00:02:32.390 --> 00:02:33.430
It's all his fault!

17
00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.300
It's because of that straw
hat guy that I'm here

18
00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:38.270
doing stupid chores instead
of living the good life.

19
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.330
[KOBY]
Hey, Helmeppo.

20
00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.690
What d'ya want? Why are
you touching me like that?

21
00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.890
You shouldn't blame
everything on Luffy like that.

22
00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:46.350
It isn't his fault; he was just
doing the right thing.

23
00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.950
[KOBY]
For a long time you could
use your father's power

24
00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:51.620
to get through life.
Things are different now.

25
00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:55.590
We've got to work long and hard on
our own to accomplish our dreams!

26
00:02:55.590 --> 00:02:56.930
Oh, please.

27
00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:58.630
[KOBY]
You know my dream?

28
00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.700
Someday I'm gonna become a
great officer in the marines!

29
00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:05.200
I'll chase bad guys and defend justice!

30
00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.290
[HELMEPPO]
How stupid can you be?!

31
00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.160
A wimp like you becoming a
marine officer like my dad?!

32
00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.530
No way that will ever happen!

33
00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:14.800
I know that it will!

34
00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.220
Thanks to Luffy, I know that
I can do anything that I want!

35
00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.870
That's right! I'm gonna
be King of the Pirates!

36
00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:25.350
I decided that long ago, and if I die
fighting for it, it's all right!

37
00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.760
[KOBY]
So I decided to be
like Luffy and do anything,

38
00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:30.970
even risk my life, to
achieve my final goal.

39
00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:32.010
Well?

40
00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.540
Now we can work hard and
reach our goals together!

41
00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.810
Forget it! You think I'm
going to listen to this?!

42
00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.590
What the heck makes you
think you can tell me

43
00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:41.260
what I should do?! And what
could you have possibly learned

44
00:03:41.260 --> 00:03:43.190
from that pathetic excuse for a pirate?

45
00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:45.130
[KOBY]
Don't talk about Luffy like that!

46
00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.530
I haven't done anything
but try to help you out!

47
00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.200
I don't remember asking for your help!

48
00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:50.900
[KOBY yells]

49
00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:51.800
[HELMEPPO yelps]

50
00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:54.310
Helmeppo, will you please
just stop acting foolish?!

51
00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:56.270
Oh, please! You're calling me a fool?!

52
00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:57.040
Take that!

53
00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.610
[KOBY]
Would you snap out of it?

54
00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.780
[LIEUTENANT]
What's going on here?

55
00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.510
[KOBY, HELMEPPO]
– We're... We're sorry, sir!
– We're... We're sorry, sir!

56
00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.620
[RIKA]
Really? That explosion
earlier was from you guys?

57
00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.620
They didn't kick you out
of the marines, did they, Koby?

58
00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:31.690
[KOBY]
Thank you, ma'am.

59
00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:35.630
No, they actually allowed
us to stay enlisted.

60
00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:39.600
Yeah, but we had to agree to
work for free for 50 years.

61
00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.290
Getting kicked out would
have been so much better.

62
00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.580
[MARINE 5]
Attention!

63
00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:52.120
[LIEUTENANT]
I will now inform you about
the nature of our mission.

64
00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.290
[screams]
Look!

65
00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.960
What do you want?

66
00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.590
[HELMEPPO]
It's my dad!

67
00:04:58.590 --> 00:05:01.430
[LIEUTENANT]
Captain Morgan is being
sent to Marine Headquarters

68
00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.800
to face a court martial for the
crimes of military exploitation

69
00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.600
and the cruel and unusual
treatment of civilians.

70
00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:11.740
Our mission is to transfer the
prisoner to Vice-Admiral Garp.

71
00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.780
[MORGAN]
Rankless, low-life bums!

72
00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.480
You have no right to
defy my superiority!

73
00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.110
I am Marine Captain Axe-hand Morgan

74
00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:25.490
[HELMEPPO, KOBY whimper]

75
00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.060
[HELMEPPO]
So I guess it's really going to happen.

76
00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:39.800
I mean, I know that he deserves to get
court-martialed and all of that.

77
00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:44.240
I get it, given the stuff
that he did, but honestly...

78
00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:47.850
even after all that,
I still respected him.

79
00:05:56.850 --> 00:05:59.680
Damn it!

80
00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:03.560
Why? [cries]

81
00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:07.330
Koby, do you think that they're
going to execute him?

82
00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:10.260
[KOBY]
I don't know.

83
00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:14.830
[HELMEPPO]
I guess I should probably be ready for
something like that to happen, huh?

84
00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:17.200
But he's my dad.

85
00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:24.430
[KOBY]
Helmeppo...

86
00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.760
[MARINE 6]
Marines! All hands on deck!

87
00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.560
[LIEUTENANT]
Fall in!

88
00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.800
[MARINE 2]
It's Vice-Admiral Garp!

89
00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:37.740
[MARINES chattering]

90
00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.840
<b>Vice Admiral Garp
Marine Headquarters</b>

91
00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.670
[KOBY]
So that's Marine Vice-Admiral Garp!

92
00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.640
The man they call the Fist!

93
00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.720
He's a great hero of the seas who
travels all over the Grand Line!

94
00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:58.580
Vice-Admiral Garp, thank you
for coming all this way.

95
00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:01.320
"Justice"

96
00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:05.390
We are pleased to deliver
Captain Morgan to you.

97
00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:06.490
[HELMEPPO]
Dad! No!

98
00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:09.890
[LIEUTENANT]
Sir, did you hear me Vice-Admiral?

99
00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:11.460
Vice-Admiral Garp, sir!

100
00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.400
Be quiet! I heard you.

101
00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:17.690
I'm a bit tired because I've
been up for five days now.

102
00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.760
You are indeed a dedicated marine, sir!

103
00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:21.530
No, I've been trying to set a record

104
00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:23.630
for the most doughnuts eaten
in a single sitting.

105
00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:24.700
Sir?

106
00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:28.030
The sugar kept me going at first,
but I've been at it for a while now,

107
00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:30.900
and I guess the lack of sleep
is starting to get to me.

108
00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.270
Old man. Cut the sleeping act already.

109
00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.130
[GARP snoring]

110
00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.970
[HELMEPPO, KOBY whimper]

111
00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.300
[MARINES gasping]

112
00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:45.370
No one move!

113
00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:47.940
[HELMEPPO whimpering]

114
00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:53.310
If anyone moves a muscle I'll hack this
chore boy up and feed him to the sharks!

115
00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.310
B-But daddy, why are you doing this?!

116
00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:58.010
Sir, please stop this!
Helmeppo is your son!

117
00:07:58.010 --> 00:08:00.080
How could you do something
like that to him?!

118
00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.650
[MORGAN]
My son? What do I need with a son?!

119
00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.650
What I want now is freedom!

120
00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.320
I don't care about his life!

121
00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:09.650
I'll cut him into a thousand
pieces if I have to!

122
00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.560
[HELMEPPO]
But... Daddy!

123
00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:13.590
[MORGAN laughing]

124
00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:16.790
[HELMEPPO]
Ah! Help me! Somebody help me, please!

125
00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.190
[MORGAN]
Good riddance, you fools!

126
00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.060
[KOBY]
Helmeppo!

127
00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.300
[BOGART]
Ready the cannon!

128
00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.000
[KOBY whimpers]

129
00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.730
Load the cannon! Take aim!

130
00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.830
Target, 16 degrees starboard.

131
00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:28.400
Distance... eight-two-six-three.

132
00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.620
Now, ready!

133
00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.160
[KOBY]
N-N-No, please just wait!

134
00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:34.390
[MARINES chattering]

135
00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:38.680
I'm begging you not to
shoot! Please, stop!

136
00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.190
He has a hostage on that boat!

137
00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.320
Move it.

138
00:08:42.320 --> 00:08:44.720
[KOBY]
I won't!

139
00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.730
In that case, you're dead.

140
00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:52.090
Maybe so, but at least I won't be
guilty of abandoning my friend!

141
00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:55.920
Please, I can fix this! I'll
capture Morgan myself!

142
00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:03.600
[KOBY screams]

143
00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.500
[LIEUTENANT]
Come back!

144
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.500
You idiot!

145
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.940
You'll never be able to
capture him by yourself!

146
00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.510
Let's let him try.

147
00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:17.850
He's either brave or
dumb, or just... dumb.

148
00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:21.380
[MARINE 6]
Well, what do we do?

149
00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:24.730
[GARP yawns]

150
00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.730
[GARP grunts]

151
00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.360
[yawns]

152
00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.030
All right, I'm awake again.

153
00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.400
Now, what's all this noise about?

154
00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.040
Vice-Admiral Garp, you're alive!

155
00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:35.070
I was certain that that
monster had killed you!

156
00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.740
What?! One of the men has been killed?!

157
00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:41.600
I can't believe I slept through
something like that! Who was it?

158
00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:47.560
Oh, right.

159
00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.660
[MARINES]
– Aiye!
– Aiye!

160
00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:53.330
[MORGAN laughs]
Free at last!

161
00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:54.530
Just you watch!

162
00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.370
The world will be kneeling at
my feet again in no time!

163
00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.960
I will rule the seas!

164
00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.740
The world will quake in terror!

165
00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:03.660
Now set our course to the west, boy!

166
00:10:03.660 --> 00:10:05.900
What are you doing?
I said set our course!

167
00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:06.740
[HELMEPPO]
No!

168
00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:07.740
Huh?

169
00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:09.910
[HELMEPPO]
I won't have any part in your plans!

170
00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.780
Koby put everything on the
line trying to save me.

171
00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:16.180
He even risked getting kicked out of the
marines to help me and they're his dream!

172
00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:20.030
He fights for what he believes in,
no matter what, and so could I!

173
00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:23.300
Dad, I'm going to capture you!
You might as well just give up...

174
00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:25.730
[MORGAN grunts]

175
00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:26.900
What do you think you're doing, brat?

176
00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:29.800
Are you too stupid to know
what you're up against, huh?

177
00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:33.310
What can a useless piece of scum
like you hope to do to me?

178
00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.350
Damn it!

179
00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.890
[MORGAN]
It's time you learned
your place, you pathetic insect!

180
00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:40.060
No, I'm not listening to you anymore!

181
00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.600
From now on, I'm the one who's
going to decide how to live my life!

182
00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:45.560
[MORGAN]
Stop being such an idiot!

183
00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.900
What can someone like you possibly do?

184
00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:50.540
[KOBY]
He can do whatever he wants!

185
00:10:51.940 --> 00:10:52.740
You came!

186
00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:54.900
[KOBY]
Stop right there, Morgan!

187
00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:01.760
[HELMEPPO groans]

188
00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.860
You two are absolutely pathetic!

189
00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:07.830
How can a couple of pitiful insects like
you expect to capture someone like me?

190
00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:11.330
If you even think about getting
in my way, I'll kill you both!

191
00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:12.700
Thank you for coming to save me.

192
00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.500
I'm sorry it turned out like this.

193
00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.470
[KOBY]
I'm glad I came!

194
00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:18.300
Aren't we friends, after all?

195
00:11:19.180 --> 00:11:20.380
Koby.

196
00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:28.440
[MORGAN]
You little pests aren't worth
the time it would take to kill you.

197
00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:31.140
I'd better never see your faces again!

198
00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.210
[HELMEPPO]
Morgan!

199
00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.280
[MORGAN]
Huh?

200
00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:36.150
I may have let you sail away
from here alive today,

201
00:11:36.150 --> 00:11:39.280
but someday I'm going to catch
you! I promise you that!

202
00:11:39.280 --> 00:11:42.320
Do you hear me? Someday
I'm going to capture you!

203
00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:44.760
Just you wait!

204
00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.220
[LIEUTENANT]
Please forgive
my poor supervision, sir.

205
00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.960
Allowing the prisoner to
escape was inexcusable.

206
00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.030
[HELMEPPO, KOBY]
– We're very sorry, too, sir!
– We're very sorry, too, sir!

207
00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:58.300
[LIEUTENANT]
After today, these two will be
kicked out of the marines for good.

208
00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.600
[HELMEPPO, KOBY whimper]

209
00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.100
[GARP]
The two of you are truly lost causes.

210
00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.100
I don't know anyone who
would take you in now,

211
00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:08.900
but turning you loose would
only burden the public.

212
00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.940
I have no choice but to take you
with me to Marine Headquarters.

213
00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:12.840
[KOBY, HELMEPPO gasp]

214
00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.040
What, Vice-Admiral?

215
00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:17.580
Sir, you're actually going to take these
two chore boys with you to headquarters?

216
00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.440
[GARP]
That a problem?

217
00:12:18.440 --> 00:12:21.040
Of course not. No problem here, sir.

218
00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.240
And do you two have a problem?

219
00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:26.150
If you want to run away,
this is your last chance.

220
00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:29.520
Not that I'd allow you to
get very far, of course.

221
00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.750
Well, now. It certainly has
been an interesting day.

222
00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:36.060
[laughs]

223
00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.820
[RIKA]
What?!

224
00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.660
Marine Headquarters?!

225
00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:52.790
Yeah.

226
00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:56.720
Vice-Admiral Garp can be
very unpredictable at times.

227
00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.280
[RIKA'S MOM]
He's pretty high up
on the food chain though, right?

228
00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.220
Yes, very high up.

229
00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:07.090
Then those two must have been very promising
to have caught his attention like that.

230
00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:12.790
[RIKA]
Stupid! Stupid!

231
00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.060
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!
[MARINES muttering]

232
00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:17.470
Why did you let them go
without saying goodbye?!

233
00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:19.590
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

234
00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:24.060
[RIKA]
I still wanted to play
with them some more.

235
00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.370
And I wanted to talk to them more.

236
00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:30.540
I was even learning how to cook.
I wanted to make them a yummy

237
00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:35.220
lunch next time they came
over but... but now I can't!

238
00:13:35.220 --> 00:13:39.520
I didn't even get to... to say
goodbye before they left!

239
00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:42.030
[MARINE A]
Uh... I...

240
00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:44.360
[RIKA]
Why did they have to leave?!

241
00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.830
[MARINE A]
Ahh! I'm sorry. Please forgive me!

242
00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:48.000
[RIKA'S MOM]
Rika, that's enough.

243
00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.960
Leave him alone now, dear.
You don't have to be so sad.

244
00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:55.170
They'll come back after they've
become fine marine officers.

245
00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.320
"The Marines"

246
00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:02.780
[HELMEPPO]
Uh, what good is this?

247
00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:07.910
<b>Marine Headquarters</b>

248
00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:05.980
How are we supposed to become
marines by mopping floors?

249
00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.880
Did you ever think that
maybe this is just a hobby

250
00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.320
that old geezer has?

251
00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.250
A hobby?

252
00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.520
Yeah.

253
00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.320
A new hobby called "tormenting
poor chore boys just for fun."

254
00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.220
I'm telling you, the
old man's crazy enough

255
00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.190
that it might be true.
Think about it for a sec.

256
00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:20.190
Would you birds stop chirping?!
